OL,3,GNEWSA'We are making opera that looks
OL,4,Aand sounds like Bradford'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's a project festival co-founder
OL,7,FCrick has wanted to create since he
OL,8,Ffirst picked up a cello at primary
OL,9,Fschool.
OL,11,F"The idea for years has been to create
OL,12,Fa festival that takes this glorious art
OL,13,Fform that I've believed in since I was
OL,14,Fa kid and deliver it to anyone and
OL,15,Feveryone in where I'm from and where I
OL,16,Fstill work," he says.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
